    <div class="prose prose-lg text-spg-text-light max-w-none space-y-8">
      <h2 class="text-3xl tracking-tight font-semibold text-spg-green border-b border-[#EDE4D4] pb-3">Information We Collect</h2>
      <p>When you browse our site, we may gather certain data automatically, such as your domain name, IP address, browser and operating system details, referring website, pages visited, and session duration. We partner with third-party providers that employ cookies and similar tracking tools to collect information for analytics, targeted advertising, and remarketing. Any details you actively submit through contact forms, quote requests, or other means on the site will also be collected. This helps us improve our handyman, plumbing, warehouse management, and property maintenance offerings and allows us to reach out about services, promotions, or policy updates.</p>

      <h2 class="text-3xl tracking-tight font-semibold text-spg-green border-b border-[#EDE4D4] pb-3">How We Use the Information</h2>
      <p>Collected information is used mainly for our own internal needs, including refining our website, services, and marketing activities. We may also use it to reply to your questions, send service information or quotes for work in Savannah, Tybee Island, Chatham County, and nearby areas, or provide updates about our company. You can unsubscribe from marketing messages whenever you wish.</p>

      <h2 class="text-3xl tracking-tight font-semibold text-spg-green border-b border-[#EDE4D4] pb-3">Securing Your Data</h2>
      <p>We follow reasonable industry practices to protect the information you provide and that we obtain, both while it is being transmitted and after we receive it. Appropriate measures are in place for data collection, storage, processing, and security to help prevent unauthorized access, alteration, disclosure, or loss of your personal details, login information, transaction records, and other data on our systems.</p>

      <h2 class="text-3xl tracking-tight font-semibold text-spg-green border-b border-[#EDE4D4] pb-3">Cookies and Similar Technologies</h2>
      <p>We may place cookies on your device to enhance your experience and remember preferences. These small files can also help track site usage. You can set your browser to reject cookies or warn you before they are placed. Be aware that some features of the website may not work as expected if cookies are disabled. Cookies on our site are not connected to personally identifiable information.</p>

      <h2 class="text-3xl tracking-tight font-semibold text-spg-green border-b border-[#EDE4D4] pb-3">Sharing Your Information</h2>
      <p>We do not sell, trade, or rent personal identification information to third parties. We may share non-identifiable, aggregated statistics about visitors with partners, affiliates, or advertisers. Information may be shared with trusted vendors who help us deliver our services (such as website hosting or analytics), and we will request consent where the law requires it.</p>

      <p>We may release personal information or IP addresses if we are required to do so by law or if we reasonably believe it is necessary to cooperate with legal investigations, safeguard our rights and property, or address potential violations of the law or our terms of use.</p>

      <p>Please remember that any information you choose to share in public areas of the internet (if applicable to our site) could be seen and used by others, and we have no control over that.</p>

      <h2 class="text-3xl tracking-tight font-semibold text-spg-green border-b border-[#EDE4D4] pb-3">Links to Other Websites</h2>
      <p>Our website may include links to external sites run by partners, suppliers, advertisers, or other organizations. We have no control over the content or privacy practices of these third-party sites and are not responsible for them. Each linked site has its own privacy policy and terms. We recommend reviewing those policies when you visit other websites.</p>

      <h2 class="text-3xl tracking-tight font-semibold text-spg-green border-b border-[#EDE4D4] pb-3">Updates to This Policy</h2>
      <p>We may revise this privacy policy from time to time. When changes are made, we will update the date at the bottom of this page. We suggest checking back regularly to see the current version. Your continued use of the website after changes are posted means you accept the revised policy.</p>

      <h2 class="text-3xl tracking-tight font-semibold text-spg-green border-b border-[#EDE4D4] pb-3">Accepting This Policy</h2>
      <p>By accessing or using our website, you agree to the terms of this privacy policy. If you do not agree, please do not use the site. Should you have any questions about how we handle your information or wish to exercise your rights regarding your data, please get in touch.</p>
